@backend = http://localhost:9091
@mvc = http://localhost:9092
@webflux = http://localhost:9093

### Backend fast
GET {{backend}}/backend/fast

### MVC + Loom: finite fan-out
GET {{mvc}}/compare/fan-out

### WebFlux/Reactor: finite fan-out
GET {{webflux}}/compare/fan-out

### MVC + Loom: one timeout budget for the whole structured operation
GET {{mvc}}/compare/global-timeout

### WebFlux/Reactor: one timeout around the composed publisher
GET {{webflux}}/compare/global-timeout

### MVC + Loom: protect downstream with Semaphore(2)
GET {{mvc}}/compare/bounded

### WebFlux/Reactor: flatMap(..., 2)
GET {{webflux}}/compare/bounded

### WebFlux/Reactor: infinite SSE stream
GET {{webflux}}/compare/events
Accept: text/event-stream
